damagetype "Elemental"
Obituary "%o turned into nothing by \ctArch \cmArcanist\c- (%k)'s \ctArcane Sphere\c-."
+CANBOUNCEWATER
+HEXENBOUNCE
-ALLOWBOUNCEONACTORS
+SKYEXPLODE
bouncefactor 0.85
wallbouncefactor 0.85
bouncecount 10
reactiontime 50
damage (75)
